      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=blue><b>The Gold of Winter</b>\r\n\r\n<color=black>The goblins
    have raided the village and stolen all of its supplies and gold just before winter.\r\n\r\nWith
    no resources left to survive, the villagers place their trust in you, a young
    adventurer, to venture into the forests, the cracked caves, and the goblin village
    to recover the stolen loot and save the village from hunger and cold.\r\n\r\n<color=red>Gather
    your strength, hero \u2014 danger lies ahead!\r\n"
